#: session.py:50
msgid "Draw the original label above every node that has a custom label. Applies to this Blender session only; the default comes from the add-on preferences"
msgstr "在每个带有自定义标签的节点上方绘制原始标签。仅对本次 Blender 会话生效；默认值来自插件偏好设置"

#: __init__.py:32
msgid "Orig. Label"
msgstr "原始标签"

#: ui.py:30
msgid "Original Label"
msgstr "原始标签"

#: session.py:50
msgid "Show Orig. Labels"
msgstr "显示原始标签"

#: preferences.py:32
msgid "Show original node labels by default (changeable per session in N-Panel, Node tab)"
msgstr "默认显示节点原始标签（可在 N 面板的「节点」选项卡中按会话更改）"

#: __init__.py:32
msgid "The label Blender would show for this node if it had no custom label"
msgstr "如果该节点没有自定义标签，Blender 将为此节点显示的标签"

#: preferences.py:32
msgid "Whether the overlay starts out enabled when Blender launches. The checkbox in the node editor's sidebar overrides this for the current session without changing this setting"
msgstr "Blender 启动时叠加层是否默认启用。节点编辑器侧栏中的复选框可在当前会话中覆盖此项，而不更改该设置"
